<title>USA: BOXING-HERNANDEZ KEEPS WBC SUPER FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-HERNANDEZ KEEPS WBC SUPER FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genaro Hernandez retained his World Boxing Council super featherweight title on Saturday with a split decision victory over Anatoly Alexandrov of Kazakhstan.</p>
</text>
